Patch intent:
Disable telemetry at its shared delivery boundary and remove the telemetry CLI,
slash command, first-run notice, onboarding header, and public policy document.

Why it exists:
This personal build must make no telemetry deliveries and must not advertise
telemetry settings or opt-out instructions to users.

Upstream integration points:
